<title>USA: Old America Q4 shr loss $1.24 vs profit.</title>
<headline>Old America Q4 shr loss $1.24 vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>HOWE, Texas 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>OLD AMERICA STORES INC.</p>
<p>($ in thousands, except for per-share and share data)</p>
<p>							 TWELVE WEEKS ENDED</p>
<p>							Jan. 31,   Jan. 31,</p>
<p>							    1997	1996</p>
<p> Net Sales					    45,791     41,459</p>
<p>Cost of goods sold</p>
<p>   (including occupancy expense)		38,477     24,948</p>
<p> Gross profit					  7,314     16,511</p>
<p>Selling, general  </p>
<p>   and administrative expense		   15,346     10,588</p>
<p> Depreciation expense				  699	  565</p>
<p> Amortization of goodwill &amp; intangibles	  127	  136</p>
<p>Income (loss) before</p>
<p>   interest and income taxes		   (8,858)	5,222</p>
<p> Interest expense, net				 508	  333</p>
